  "evidence": {
    "semantics": [
      "pattgen_reg_pkg.sv defines offsets 0x00..0x2c and two completion IRQ bits.",
      "pattgen_chan.sv emits DATA least-significant bit first, LEN+1 bits repeated REPS+1 times; each half clock period is PREDIV+1 input clocks.",
      "Configuration is latched while disabled. Output enables are always one.",
      "The scalar wrapper fixes alert_rx to prim_alert_pkg::ALERT_RX_DEFAULT and exposes every native output."
    ],
    "verified": [
      "Pinned source manifest authenticates RTL, include files, scalar wrapper and successful Verilator elaboration."
    ],
    "unknown": [
      "Generic session has no external serial peer; channel protocol behavior is checked from native tick receipts in real tests."
    ]
